mwork is critical. Might be disqualifying.\n\nCandidate D's hot temper could be dangerous under stress. Candidate C's communication difficulty could affect crew.\n\nCandidate A's leadership and anticipation may be valuable, but show-off may affect crew. Not open to new ideas may affect adaptability.\n\nGiven limited info, perhaps Candidate B is strongest overall: reliability, stress, technical (weather, computer). The concerns (nasty remarks) could be mitigated with training, but still serious. However, we need to argue.\n\nWe can start with recommending Candidate B, citing strengths and acknowledging concerns, and suggest we need to discuss others.\n\nThus public message: I recommend Candidate B, based on conscientiousness, stress handling, weather assessment, but note concerns about memory and remarks. Suggest we compare with others.\n\nProvide metadata vote B.\n\nLet's produce."}
